.TH VRAS-SUBMODULE 1 "September 2026" "v1.0.0" "Vikyek's Rouge Agent Singularity Manual"
.SH NAME
vras-submodule, vras \- Manage and toggle VRAS submodules easily
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vras-submodule
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIMODULE\fR]
.br
.B vras
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIMODULE\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBvras-submodule\fR is a lightweight CLI utility designed to inspect, enable, disable, and toggle submodules within Vikyek's Rouge Agent Singularity (VRAS).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list, status
Display status (ENABLED/DISABLED) and git commit SHA of all registered submodules.
.TP
.B enable [MODULE|all], on, add
Initialize and checkout the specified submodule (or all submodules).
.TP
.B disable [MODULE|all], off, rm, remove
Deinitialize and clear the working tree of the specified submodule (or all submodules).
.TP
.B toggle MODULE, switch
Toggle the status of the specified submodule on or off.
.SH MODULE SHORTCUTS
.TP
.B dispatcher, agv-dispatcher
Token-efficient task dispatcher & self-scaling orchestrator.
.TP
.B jules, jules-vanager
Google Jules API Manager, Listener Daemon, TUI, and Conky HUD.
.TP
.B sync, agv-syncengine
Preference vault sync template and conflict resolution engine.
.TP
.B toon, toon-mcp
TOON-format token optimization MCP server.
.TP
.B all
Operate on all submodules simultaneously.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B vras list
Show status of all submodules.
.TP
.B vras enable toon
Enable the toon-mcp submodule.
.TP
.B vras disable jules
Disable the jules-vanager submodule.
.TP
.B vras toggle dispatcher
Toggle the agv-dispatcher submodule state.
